{"version":1,"content":"<p>【擋住先 ✅】Cloudflare 宣布針對 PHP 致命漏洞威脅，為全球所有免費及付費用戶部署 WAF 託管防禦規則。</p><p>透過分析請求（Request）與回應（Response），當黑客嘗試利用該 PHP 漏洞發動攻擊時，系統能即時識別惡意請求並予以攔截，為尚未部署修補程式的伺服器提供基礎防護屏障，大幅降低伺服器遭入侵與資料外洩的風險。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T08:22:29.706658+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:57:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T10:37:43.699012+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:17:42.878921+00:00","content_hash":"d07c4e33dc8d70c824fafa5372f1b469370cb976412baaef4c4b39f6abcad5dc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}